<title>HONG KONG: Glencore to supply concentrates to Thai Copper.</title>
<headline>Glencore to supply concentrates to Thai Copper.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glencore Asia Ltd said in a statement on Monday that it had signed an agreement with Thai Copper Industries Public Co Ltd to supply copper concentrates.</p>
<p>The Copper Concentrates' Frame and Agency Agreements would also allow Glencore to act as Thai Copper's agent to coordinate with copper mines for long-term supply of copper concentrates, it said without giving further details.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
</text>
